    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CommunityConnect: check numbers\n\nWhen a contact is added (or their number changes), Supabase asks here whether the number is a **mobile or a landline** (Twilio Lookup, $0.008 per number). A landline set to Text is switched to phone calls automatically and the office is told.\n\nExisting contacts are checked a few at a time, every 5 minutes. Canadian numbers are skipped (Twilio needs special approval for those).\n\nNo passwords in this workflow. Credentials: **CommunityConnect dispatch secret** on the first step, **Twilio account** on the Twilio step, **Supabase** on the last step. After pasting: check the three credentials, then **Publish**.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "6045aafa-06c0-472e-b566-2ad9fb8d0b4e",
      "name": "Read Me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
